// 本文件装配站内消息中心：领域规则来自框架 messaging 包，这里只负责配置、用户目录、附件服务与实时 Hub 的接线。
// This file wires the in-app message centre: the rules live in the framework messaging package, while this file only
// connects configuration, the user directory, the attachment service and the realtime hub.

package service

import (
	"{{ .Module }}/internal/repository"
	"{{ .YdxModule }}/config"
	"{{ .YdxModule }}/errs"
	ydlog "{{ .YdxModule }}/log"
	"{{ .YdModule }}/messaging"
	"{{ .YdModule }}/messaging/authdirectory"
	"{{ .YdModule }}/messaging/markdown"
	"{{ .YdModule }}/messaging/realtime"
)

// 消息中心配置键：与 configs/config.yaml 的 message 段一一对应，YD_MESSAGE_* 自动映射。
// Message-centre configuration keys: they match the message section of configs/config.yaml and YD_MESSAGE_* maps onto them.
const (
	// configRecallWindow bounds a regular author's recall. | configRecallWindow 限制普通作者的撤回窗口。
	configRecallWindow = "message.recall_window"
	// configEditWindow bounds a regular author's edit. | configEditWindow 限制普通作者的编辑窗口。
	configEditWindow = "message.edit_window"
	// configMaxAttachments is the files-per-message ceiling. | configMaxAttachments 是单条消息的附件数上限。
	configMaxAttachments = "message.max_attachments"
	// configMaxGroupMembers is the group member ceiling. | configMaxGroupMembers 是群成员上限。
	configMaxGroupMembers = "message.max_group_members"
	// configPageSize is the default page length. | configPageSize 是默认页长。
	configPageSize = "message.page_size"
)

// ErrMessageUnavailable reports a message centre without a usable store. | ErrMessageUnavailable 表示消息中心没有可用存储。
var ErrMessageUnavailable = errs.New("message centre is unavailable | 消息中心不可用")

// MessageService is the project-facing facade of the messaging domain. | MessageService 是消息领域对项目侧的门面。
type MessageService struct {
	// Service is the embedded domain service; nil means the centre is unavailable. | Service 是内嵌的领域服务；nil 表示消息中心不可用。
	*messaging.Service
	// hub fans realtime events out to WebSocket subscribers. | hub 把实时事件分发给 WebSocket 订阅者。
	hub *realtime.Hub
}

// NewMessageService assembles the message centre over the project's store and configuration. |
// NewMessageService 在项目存储与配置之上装配消息中心。
//
// The realtime hub is created even when the store is unavailable, so the controller always has one
// object to pass to its WebSocket endpoint; the endpoint itself refuses when the service is nil.
// attachmentSvc may be nil, which disables uploads and downloads while keeping every other feature. |
// 即使存储不可用也会创建实时 Hub，使控制器总有一个对象可交给 WebSocket 端点；服务为 nil 时端点自行拒绝。
// attachmentSvc 可以为 nil，此时只关闭上传与下载，其余功能照常可用。
func NewMessageService(store *repository.Store, hub *realtime.Hub, cfg *config.Config, log *ydlog.Logger, attachmentSvc *AttachmentService) (*MessageService, error) {
	if log == nil {
		log = ydlog.Default()
	}
	if hub == nil {
		hub = realtime.New(log)
	}
	if store == nil || !store.MessageAvailable() {
		reason := messaging.ErrUnavailable
		if store != nil && store.MessageError() != nil {
			reason = store.MessageError()
		}
		return &MessageService{hub: hub}, errs.Wrap(reason, ErrMessageUnavailable)
	}
	directory, err := authdirectory.New(store.Auth())
	if err != nil {
		return &MessageService{hub: hub}, errs.Wrap(err, ErrMessageUnavailable)
	}

	options := messaging.DefaultOptions()
	if cfg != nil {
		if value := cfg.Duration(configRecallWindow); value > 0 {
			options.RecallWindow = value
		}
		if value := cfg.Duration(configEditWindow); value > 0 {
			options.EditWindow = value
		} else {
			options.EditWindow = options.RecallWindow
		}
		if value := cfg.GetInt(configMaxAttachments); value > 0 {
			options.MaxAttachments = value
		}
		if value := cfg.GetInt(configMaxGroupMembers); value > 0 {
			options.MaxMembers = value
		}
		if value := cfg.GetInt(configPageSize); value > 0 {
			options.PageSize = value
		}
	}

	// The concrete pointer is converted here: a typed nil stored in the interface would be non-nil
	// and would make the message centre call into a nil service. | 在这里转换具体指针：把带类型的 nil
	// 存进接口会得到非 nil 接口，消息中心随后会调用到 nil 服务上。
	var attachmentDomain messaging.AttachmentService
	if attachmentSvc != nil {
		attachmentDomain = attachmentSvc.Service
	}
	svc, err := messaging.New(store.MessageStore(), directory, markdown.New(), attachmentDomain, hub, log, options)
	if err != nil {
		return &MessageService{hub: hub}, errs.Wrap(err, ErrMessageUnavailable)
	}
	return &MessageService{Service: svc, hub: hub}, nil
}

// Available reports whether the message centre can serve requests. | Available 报告消息中心能否服务请求。
func (m *MessageService) Available() bool { return m != nil && m.Service != nil }

// Hub returns the realtime hub, which is never nil after construction. | Hub 返回实时 Hub，构造后永不为 nil。
func (m *MessageService) Hub() *realtime.Hub {
	if m == nil {
		return nil
	}
	return m.hub
}
